    "title": "Kaya's Busy Day",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya had home economics class today.",
      "They made curry with corn.",
      "Her teacher warned they mustn't heat it quickly.",
      "Kaya added one ounce of spices.",
      "After that, she went to brass band practice.",
      "She knew the bell would ring in forty minutes.",
      "Her research project was about a dolphin and an octopus.",
      "Kaya wasn't scared; she knew, 'We'll certainly finish!'",
      "She looked forward to spaghetti for dinner, of course.",
